title: Envelope
text: The flap is stuck down tight, unless you come at the seams on the slant.
trick: a diagonal wall stops straight beams but a beam crossing it at right angles slips between the bricks; straight beams need a teleporter
motif: back of an envelope: a V-shaped flap of walls across the top
ink: 4
expect: depth>=2
